# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy13.rpy:12
translate italian izzy13_8ca62be9:

    # gl "Hey Twig! Guess what? I got the job!"
    gl "Ehi Twig! Indovina un po'? Ho ottenuto il lavoro!"

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy13.rpy:13
translate italian izzy13_68c72b69:

    # pc "Hey, congratulations!"
    pc "Ehi, congratulazioni!"

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy13.rpy:14
translate italian izzy13_5a2b96eb:

    # pc "I guess that means you'll be leaving soon, Mari?"
    pc "Immagino che questo significhi che te ne andrai presto, Mari?"

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy13.rpy:15
translate italian izzy13_d83a5365:

    # fr "Yeah, I'm going to train her for a little while, then I'm done."
    fr "Sì, la formerò per un po', poi avrò finito."

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy13.rpy:16
translate italian izzy13_1591b993:

    # fr "It's a little sad, but I'm glad that Jackson has a good person to take my position."
    fr "È un po’ triste, ma sono contenta che Jackson abbia trovato una brava persona che prenda il mio posto."

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy13.rpy:17
translate italian izzy13_93f32351:

    # gl "Thanks, girl. I appreciate that."
    gl "Grazie, ragazza. Lo apprezzo molto."

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy13.rpy:18
translate italian izzy13_0ce62e11:

    # gl "Well, let's get your order in."
    gl "Beh, andiamo a prendere la tua ordinazione."

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy13.rpy:21
translate italian izzy13_5e8dd55b:

    # "Izzy leads me back to my booth, with Mari trailing along behind her, supervising."
    "Izzy mi accompagna al mio tavolo, con Mari che la segue da dietro, supervisionando."

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy13.rpy:22
translate italian izzy13_44f9ac2a:

    # gl "So what are you having today?"
    gl "Allora, cosa prendi oggi?"

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy13.rpy:23
translate italian izzy13_6c37c9c9:

    # pc "Cheeseburger with everything, fries, and a coke."
    pc "Cheeseburger con tutto, patatine fritte e una Coca-Cola."

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy13.rpy:24
translate italian izzy13_61e49ea3:

    # gl "Simple. I like it. Give me a few minutes."
    gl "Semplice. Mi piace. Dammi qualche minuto."

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy13.rpy:27
translate italian izzy13_12885faf:

    # "Izzy rushes off to the back to put my order in."
    "Izzy si precipita nel retro per inserire la mia ordinazione."

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy13.rpy:28
translate italian izzy13_c78badbd:

    # pc "So how are things going? How is she doing?"
    pc "Allora, come vanno le cose? Come se la cava?"

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy13.rpy:29
translate italian izzy13_85b43910:

    # fr "She's doing great so far. Jackson likes her a lot."
    fr "Finora sta andando alla grande. Jackson la apprezza molto."

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy13.rpy:30
translate italian izzy13_278c283a:

    # fr "She's pretty sassy. Jackson loves that."
    fr "È piuttosto sfacciata. A Jackson piace un sacco."

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy13.rpy:31
translate italian izzy13_c478ef3e:

    # pc "Good. I'm really happy it's working out."
    pc "Bene. Sono davvero felice che stia funzionando."

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy13.rpy:32
translate italian izzy13_ecc2451e:

    # fr "Me too!"
    fr "Anch’io!"

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy13.rpy:33
translate italian izzy13_a3a72879:

    # fr "Well, I better get back to helping her. I'll talk to you later, [pcname]."
    fr "Beh, è meglio che torni ad aiutarla. Ci sentiamo più tardi, [pcname]."

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy13.rpy:34
translate italian izzy13_53fa2ef6:

    # pc "Okay, see ya."
    pc "Ok, ci vediamo."

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy13.rpy:37
translate italian izzy13_69b02f38:

    # "Mari leaves and I play on my phone for a few minutes until Izzy returns with my food."
    "Mari se ne va e io gioco con il cellulare per qualche minuto finché Izzy non torna con il mio cibo."

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy13.rpy:40
translate italian izzy13_3cd8bfcc:

    # gl "Got your burger ready, Twig. Enjoy."
    gl "Il tuo hamburger è pronto, Twig. Buon appetito."

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy13.rpy:41
translate italian izzy13_97e892af:

    # pc "Thanks! I'm sure I will."
    pc "Grazie! Sono sicuro che mi piacerà."

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy13.rpy:42
translate italian izzy13_8dc0436a:

    # gl "So you and Mari have a thing going on?"
    gl "Quindi tra te e Mari c’è qualcosa?"

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy13.rpy:43
translate italian izzy13_999c143d:

    # pc "Yeah, we've been dating some."
    pc "Sì, usciamo insieme da un po’."

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy13.rpy:44
translate italian izzy13_f21ed68a:

    # gl "Man, she's so hot."
    gl "Cavolo, è davvero sexy."

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy13.rpy:45
translate italian izzy13_a996b478:

    # gl "We should all three get together sometime, you know?"
    gl "Dovremmo uscire tutti e tre insieme qualche volta, sai?"

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy13.rpy:46
translate italian izzy13_f945ea47:

    # pc "Yeah maybe. We'll see."
    pc "Sì, magari. Vedremo."

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy13.rpy:47
translate italian izzy13_0827ec33:

    # gl "Anyway, let me know if you need anything. I gotta go take care of those assholes over there."
    gl "Comunque, fammi sapere se ti serve qualcosa. Devo andare a occuparmi di quegli stronzi laggiù."

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy13.rpy:48
translate italian izzy13_49912e7a:

    # pc "Alright, I will."
    pc "Va bene, lo farò."

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy13.rpy:51
translate italian izzy13_410fc4ec:

    # "Izzy goes to help other customers and I eat my meal."
    "Izzy va ad aiutare altri clienti e io mangio il mio pasto."

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy13.rpy:54
translate italian izzy13_1afb6a34:

    # "Then a few minutes later, Izzy and Mari return."
    "Poi, qualche minuto dopo, Izzy e Mari tornano."

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy13.rpy:55
translate italian izzy13_b99c5a01:

    # gl "Did you like your burger?"
    gl "Ti è piaciuto il tuo hamburger?"

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy13.rpy:56
translate italian izzy13_a248948f:

    # pc "Of course."
    pc "Certo."

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy13.rpy:57
translate italian izzy13_d2f1177a:

    # gl "I know, right? They're so fucking good."
    gl "Lo so, vero? Sono fottutamente buoni."

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy13.rpy:58
translate italian izzy13_4a0f9f0f:

    # gl "I'm going to end up eating so many, working here. My ass is gonna get {i}fat{/i}!"
    gl "Finirò per mangiarne tantissimi, lavorando qui. Il mio culo diventerà {i}grasso{/i}!"

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy13.rpy:59
translate italian izzy13_bad98252:

    # gl "How do you stay so fit, Mari?"
    gl "Come fai a mantenerti così in forma, Mari?"

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy13.rpy:60
translate italian izzy13_2202a21b:

    # fr "Benefits of being vegetarian."
    fr "I vantaggi di essere vegetariana."

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy13.rpy:61
translate italian izzy13_03e1f782:

    # gl "Well I sure as hell ain't doing that!"
    gl "Beh, io di sicuro non lo farò mai!"

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy13.rpy:62
translate italian izzy13_481c466b:

    # gl "Anyways, have a good day, Twig. I'll see you later."
    gl "Comunque, buona giornata, Twig. Ci vediamo più tardi."

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy13.rpy:63
translate italian izzy13_1af352a6:

    # fr "Yeah, bye [pcname]. Thanks for coming in."
    fr "Sì, ciao [pcname]. Grazie per essere passata."

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy13.rpy:66
translate italian izzy13_afdbb1fc:

    # "They start to walk away, and Izzy looks back at me."
    "Cominciano ad allontanarsi, e Izzy si volta a guardarmi."

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy13.rpy:67
translate italian izzy13_65d07413:

    # gl "You better give me a good tip. I was downright fucking pleasant."
    gl "Farai meglio a darmi una bella mancia. Sono stata davvero fottutamente gentile."

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy13.rpy:68
translate italian izzy13_8a5abc7f:

    # pc "I'll give you more than the tip."
    pc "Ti darò più della mancia."

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy13.rpy:69
translate italian izzy13_8f001d5e:

    # gl "Don't tease me, Twig. I have to work 'til closing today."
    gl "Non stuzzicarmi, Twig. Oggi devo lavorare fino alla chiusura."

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy13.rpy:70
translate italian izzy13_864b9473:

    # pc "Have fun."
    pc "Divertiti."

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy13.rpy:71
translate italian izzy13_4772f020:

    # gl "Yeah, yeah. See ya."
    gl "Sì, sì. Ci vediamo."

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy13.rpy:74
translate italian izzy13_2cf41d4f:

    # "With a smile, I leave a generous tip on the table and leave."
    "Con un sorriso, lascio una generosa mancia sul tavolo e me ne vado."

# game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy13.rpy:75
translate italian izzy13_b9414cfd:

    # "It's good to see Izzy doing well. I hope the job works out for her."
    "È bello vedere che Izzy se la cava bene. Spero che il lavoro vada a buon fine per lei."

translate italian strings:

    # game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy13.rpy:1
    old "You'll need to progress far enough with Izzy that she is looking for a job. You will also have to progress far enough with Mari that she tells you she is leaving Jackson Burger."
    new "Dovrai progredire abbastanza con Izzy da far sì che lei stia cercando un lavoro. Dovrai anche progredire abbastanza con Mari da far sì che ti dica che sta lasciando il Jackson Burger."

    # game/Scenes/Izzy/izzy13.rpy:2
    old "Have conversations with Izzy asking what kind of job she is looking for, then have the conversation to suggest Jackson Burger. Then this scene will happen when you next go to Jackson Burger."
    new "Parla con Izzy chiedendole che tipo di lavoro sta cercando, poi avvia la conversazione per suggerirle il Jackson Burger. A quel punto, questa scena si verificherà la prossima volta che andrai al Jackson Burger."

